# Authentication endpoints
GET {{Agent.Portal_HostAddress}}/api/auth/user
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Agent.Portal_HostAddress}}/api/auth/profile
Accept: application/json

###

# Get Azure Resource Manager token (requires authentication)
GET {{Agent.Portal_HostAddress}}/api/auth/arm-token
Accept: application/json

